1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,980
Bend your finger like a hook...

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:04,540
now straighten just the TIP.

3
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:05,360
Can't?

4
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:07,133
Your tip just went...

5
00:00:07,176 --> 00:00:08,720
OFFLINE.

6
00:00:08,858 --> 00:00:09,550
Poke it.

7
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:10,733
Floppy, right?

8
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:11,659
Bend the middle,

9
00:00:11,659 --> 00:00:13,300
and its string goes tight...

10
00:00:13,351 --> 00:00:16,144
the tip's two go SLACK.

11
00:00:16,839 --> 00:00:18,233
Doctors use this exact test...

12
00:00:19,085 --> 00:00:20,633
on jammed fingers.

13
00:00:21,165 --> 00:00:23,433
If that tip goes STIFF...

14
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,567
the middle string might be torn.

15
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:26,780
Still floppy?

16
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:27,800
Congrats...

17
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:29,252
you're FINE.

